<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Pembayaran Terkonfirmasi ✅</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      background-color: #f5f5f5;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669 0%, #10b981 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: 40px 24px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header-icon { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; }
    .header p { margin: 8px 0 0; font-size: 16px; opacity: 0.9; }
    .content { padding: 32px 24px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #1a1a1a; }
    .message { color: #4a4a4a; margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 14px; }
    .section-title {
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      margin: 28px 0 12px;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .section-icon { margin-right: 8px; }
    .details-box {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .detail-row {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 14px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .detail-row:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .detail-label {
      color: #6b7280;
      font-weight: 500;
      float: left;
    }
    .detail-value {
      color: #1a1a1a;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: right;
      float: right;
      max-width: 60%;
    }
    .room-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-bottom: 0;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .room-table th {
      background-color: #f1f5f9;
      color: #475569;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: left;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .room-table td {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      color: #334155;
    }
    .room-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .total-row {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669 0%, #10b981 100%);
      border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .total-label {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500;
      float: left;
    }
    .total-value {
      color: #ffffff;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      float: right;
    }
    .status-badge {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #dcfce7;
      color: #166534;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .booking-id {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #f0fdf4;
      color: #059669;
      font-family: monospace;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }
    .rules-box {
      background-color: #fffbeb;
      border: 1px solid #fde68a;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .rule-item {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #4a4a4a;
    }
    .rule-item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .rule-icon {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-right: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    .rule-text {
      display: inline-block;
      vertical-align: top;
      max-width: 90%;
    }
    .tips-box {
      background-color: #f0fdf4;
      border: 1px solid #bbf7d0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .tip-item {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #4a4a4a;
    }
    .tip-item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .tip-icon {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-right: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    .tip-text {
      display: inline-block;
      vertical-align: top;
      max-width: 90%;
    }
    .subtext { color: #6b7280; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 20px; }
    .footer {
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .footer p { margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; }
    .brand { font-weight: 600; color: #059669; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="header">
      <div class="header-icon">✅</div>
      <h1>Pembayaran Terkonfirmasi!</h1>
      <p>Pemesanan Anda telah berhasil dikonfirmasi</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="content">
      <p class="greeting">Halo {{name}},</p>

      <div class="status-badge">✓ PEMBAYARAN BERHASIL</div>

      <p class="message">
        Selamat! Pembayaran Anda telah kami terima dan pemesanan Anda di
        <strong>{{propertyName}}</strong> telah dikonfirmasi. Berikut adalah detail
        pemesanan beserta informasi penting yang perlu Anda ketahui sebelum menginap.
      </p>

      <!-- Booking ID -->
      <p style="margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 14px;">
        Booking ID: <span class="booking-id">#{{reservationId}}</span>
      </p>

      <!-- ═══ DETAIL PEMESANAN ═══ -->
      <div class="section-title">
        <span class="section-icon">📋</span> Detail Pemesanan
      </div>
      <div class="details-box">
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Properti</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{propertyName}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Alamat</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{propertyAddress}}{{#if propertyCity}}, {{propertyCity}}{{/if}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Check-in</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{checkinDate}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Check-out</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{checkoutDate}}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-row">
          <span class="detail-label">Durasi</span>
          <span class="detail-value">{{nights}} malam</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ═══ DETAIL KAMAR ═══ -->
      <div class="section-title">
        <span class="section-icon">🛏️</span> Detail Kamar
      </div>
      <div class="details-box" style="padding: 0; overflow: hidden;">
        <table class="room-table">
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Kamar</th>
              <th>Malam</th>
              <th style="text-align: right;">Harga</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {{#each rooms}}
            <tr>
              <td>{{this.name}}</td>
              <td>{{this.nights}} malam</td>
              <td style="text-align: right; font-weight: 600;">Rp {{this.price}}</td>
            </tr>
            {{/each}}
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <div class="total-row">
          <span class="total-label">Total Pembayaran</span>
          <span class="total-value">Rp {{totalPrice}}</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ═══ TATA CARA PENGGUNAAN PROPERTI ═══ -->
      <div class="section-title">
        <span class="section-icon">📖</span> Tata Cara Penggunaan Properti
      </div>
      <div class="tips-box">
        <div class="tip-item">
          <span class="tip-icon">🕐</span>
          <span class="tip-text">
            <strong>Check-in:</strong> Waktu check-in mulai pukul <strong>14:00</strong>.
            Silakan menghubungi pengelola properti jika ingin melakukan early check-in.
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="tip-item">
          <span class="tip-icon">🕛</span>
          <span class="tip-text">
            <strong>Check-out:</strong> Waktu check-out maksimal pukul <strong>12:00</strong>
            pada tanggal check-out. Keterlambatan dapat dikenakan biaya tambahan.
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="tip-item">
          <span class="tip-icon">🪪</span>
          <span class="tip-text">
            <strong>Identitas:</strong> Siapkan kartu identitas (KTP/Passport) saat check-in
            untuk proses verifikasi.
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="tip-item">
          <span class="tip-icon">🔑</span>
          <span class="tip-text">
            <strong>Kunci &amp; Akses:</strong> Kunci kamar akan diberikan saat check-in.
            Pastikan kunci dikembalikan saat check-out.
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="tip-item">
          <span class="tip-icon">📶</span>
          <span class="tip-text">
            <strong>Fasilitas:</strong> Informasi WiFi dan fasilitas lainnya akan diberikan
            oleh pengelola saat Anda tiba.
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ═══ ATURAN PENGGUNAAN PROPERTI ═══ -->
      <div class="section-title">
        <span class="section-icon">⚠️</span> Aturan Penggunaan Properti
      </div>
      <div class="rules-box">
        <div class="rule-item">
          <span class="rule-icon">🚭</span>
          <span class="rule-text">Dilarang merokok di dalam ruangan. Area merokok tersedia di luar bangunan.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="rule-item">
          <span class="rule-icon">🐾</span>
          <span class="rule-text">Hewan peliharaan tidak diperbolehkan kecuali ada persetujuan tertulis dari pengelola.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="rule-item">
          <span class="rule-icon">🔇</span>
          <span class="rule-text">Harap menjaga ketenangan, terutama pada pukul 22:00 - 07:00 demi kenyamanan tamu lainnya.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="rule-item">
          <span class="rule-icon">🏠</span>
          <span class="rule-text">Jaga kebersihan dan kerapihan properti selama menginap. Kerusakan fasilitas akan menjadi tanggung jawab tamu.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="rule-item">
          <span class="rule-icon">🎉</span>
          <span class="rule-text">Mengadakan pesta atau acara di dalam properti tidak diperbolehkan tanpa izin sebelumnya.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="rule-item">
          <span class="rule-icon">👥</span>
          <span class="rule-text">Tamu tambahan di luar jumlah yang terdaftar pada pemesanan harap melapor ke pengelola.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="rule-item">
          <span class="rule-icon">🗑️</span>
          <span class="rule-text">Buang sampah pada tempat yang telah disediakan. Pemisahan sampah organik dan anorganik sangat dianjurkan.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="subtext">
        Jika Anda memiliki pertanyaan atau membutuhkan bantuan, silakan hubungi pengelola
        properti melalui dashboard Rentivo Anda. Selamat berlibur! 🌟
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Terima kasih telah memilih Rentivo.</p>
      <p>&copy; 2026 <span class="brand">Rentivo App</span>. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>